  "text_matches": {
    "docs/reports/第一篇论文_第1章引言草稿_20261017.md": [
      {
        "line": 29,
        "text": "where $\\mu$ is the resist viscosity and $\\nabla_\\parallel$ is the in-plane gradient [2,4]. For a line-and-space pattern the two principal components follow from two elementary rules: along the grooves the pressure gradient is common and the fluxes add, giving an arithmetic average of the cubic conductances; across them the flux is common and the pressure drops add, giving a harmonic average. For an equal-width line-and-space pattern ($w/P=1/2$) of period $P$, groove width $w$ and groove depth $d$, with a residual gap $h$ under the protrusions,"
      },
      {
        "line": 66,
        "text": "This paper evaluates the depth-integrated transport tensor for steady, fully filled flow in explicitly represented periodic rectangular grooves of period $P=240$ nm and width $w=120$ nm. Eighteen sampled geometries span $h=25$–$125$ nm and $d=25$–$120$ nm without forming a complete grid; the error map contains 36 principal-direction calculations. The case inventory, the refinement and viscosity checks, and the audit of existing output are given in Secs. II and III."
      },
      {
        "line": 97,
        "text": "All results concern a continuous, incompressible, Newtonian liquid with no-slip walls in a fixed, fully filled, ideal periodic geometry. The viscosity independence of the extracted coefficients is checked in Sec. III; it is a consistency check of the assumed linear transport law, not a validation for all resists."
      },
      {
        "line": 99,
        "text": "Fixed-gap coefficients may supply local inputs to a future slowly varying squeeze-flow model, provided its scale separation, conservation law and boundary conditions are independently justified. The present calculations do not validate dynamic filling, free surfaces, wetting, trapped gas, real-resist slip or rheology, pattern junctions, or other geometries. The single-phase restriction is not cosmetic: once a gas phase occupies part of the void, saturation enters as an independent variable, the coefficient ceases to be a property of the geometry alone and becomes a relative permeability requiring calibration against a saturation curve [11], and a viscosity ratio and capillary number enter that this comparison does not contain. No independent same-geometry solver or experimental comparison is claimed."
      },
      {
        "line": 260,
        "text": "| 原 ¶14 的「four refinement runs, two viscosity checks and six oblique-drive runs … total to 48」等三句 | 删，改为指向 Secs. II and III | 48 次运行的清单与 Table VI 在**第 3 章 §F**已有完整版 |"
      },
      {
        "line": 262,
        "text": "| 原 ¶23 的黏度校核数 −0.000644% / −0.000283% | 删，改为指向 Sec. III | 两数在**第 3 章仍在**（已核，2 处） |"
      }
    ],
    "docs/reports/第一篇论文_第2章方法草稿_20261017.md": [
      {
        "line": 16,
        "text": "The computational domain is one period of an infinite line-and-space pattern, shown in FIG. 1(b) and 1(c). A rigid mold carries rectangular ribs of width $P-w$ separated by grooves of width $w$; the ribs stand a distance $h$ above a flat, rigid substrate, so the groove depth measured from the rib face is $d$. The pattern repeats with period $P$ along $x$, and the grooves extend without bound along $y$. The resist is treated as a Newtonian liquid of density $\\rho$ and dynamic viscosity $\\mu$ that completely fills the available volume — the film of thickness $h$ beneath the ribs and the groove volume of depth $h+d$ — so that the calculation contains no gas phase and no free surface."
      },
      {
        "line": 24,
        "text": "计算域取无限长线槽图案的一个周期，见 FIG. 1(b) and 1(c)。刚性模具上带有宽度为 $P-w$ 的凸台，凸台之间是宽度为 $w$ 的槽；凸台底面距平刚性基板 $h$，故自凸台底面量起的槽深为 $d$。图案沿 $x$ 以周期 $P$ 重复，槽沿 $y$ 方向无限延伸。胶体视为密度 $\\rho$、动力黏度 $\\mu$ 的牛顿流体，**完全充满**可用体积——凸台下方厚度为 $h$ 的薄层，以及深度为 $h+d$ 的槽内体积——因此计算中**不含气相、不含自由液面**。"
      },
      {
        "line": 102,
        "text": "where $\\tau$ is the relaxation time, $f_i^{\\rm eq}$ the equilibrium distribution and $F_i$ the forcing term accounting for $\\mathbf{a}$. The kinematic viscosity follows from the relaxation time as"
      },
      {
        "line": 110,
        "text": "so that with the grid spacing $\\Delta x$ fixed by the geometry, $\\Delta t$ and $\\tau$ are tied by the requirement $\\nu=10^{-6}$ m² s⁻¹. The choice $\\tau=1$ is used throughout: it places the solution away from the stability boundary at $\\tau\\to\\tfrac12$, and it is a standard choice for steady Stokes flow, where accuracy is limited by the boundary treatment rather than by the collision model. The corresponding time step is $\\Delta t=4.1667\\times10^{-12}$ s and the lattice viscosity is $\\nu^\\ast=\\nu\\Delta t/\\Delta x^2=1/6$."
      },
      {
        "line": 130,
        "text": "其中 $\\tau$ 为松弛时间，$f_i^{\\rm eq}$ 为平衡态分布，$F_i$ 为体现 $\\mathbf{a}$ 的力项。运动黏度由松弛时间给出："
      },
      {
        "line": 138,
        "text": "于是网格步长 $\\Delta x$ 由几何确定后，$\\Delta t$ 与 $\\tau$ 由 $\\nu=10^{-6}$ m² s⁻¹ 这一要求绑定。全文取 $\\tau=1$：该值使解远离 $\\tau\\to\\tfrac12$ 处的稳定边界，也是稳态 Stokes 流动的标准取值——此类问题中精度受边界处理而非碰撞模型限制。对应时间步 $\\Delta t=4.1667\\times10^{-12}$ s，格点黏度 $\\nu^\\ast=\\nu\\Delta t/\\Delta x^2=1/6$。"
      },
      {
        "line": 156,
        "text": "Steady state is declared when the flux has converged in a window of 1000 consecutive steps, with the relative standard deviation of both the streamwise and the cross-stream flux below $10^{-6}$ and the relative span below $5\\times10^{-6}$, and the run is stopped at 60 000 steps if this is not reached. In practice all reported cases converged well within the limit."
      },
      {
        "line": 164,
        "text": "稳态判据为：通量在连续 1000 步的窗口内收敛，流向与横向通量的相对标准差均低于 $10^{-6}$、相对极差低于 $5\\times10^{-6}$；若未达到，则在 60 000 步时停止。实际所有报告算例均远早于此收敛。"
      },
      {
        "line": 172,
        "text": "The 48 existing formal runs comprise 36 principal-direction map cases at 18 geometries, four refinement runs, two viscosity checks and six oblique-drive checks. The map is not a complete grid over its enclosing parameter ranges. The nine calibration geometries belong to the original V1 model development. The d=75 nm batch provides the original V1 withheld-depth check; d=120 nm and h=25 nm provide extension checks. V2 is now the adopted empirical formula; these already visible batches remain retrospective evaluation data, not independent final tests. Selected output checks for all 48 runs are documented in Sec. III F; they do not establish complete source/build provenance."
      },
      {
        "line": 184,
        "text": "| Viscosity | h=75, d=100 | 2 | μ=15 mPa s, P/T |"
      },
      {
        "line": 189,
        "text": "48次既有正式运行由18种几何的36个主方向地图工况、4个加密、2个黏度对照和6个斜向驱动组成。外框范围不代表完整交叉矩阵。九种标定几何用于原V1开发；d=75 nm为原V1留出深度检验，d=120 nm与h=25 nm为扩展检查。V2现已作为当前经验公式采用，但这些已可见数据仍只能作回顾性评价，不能重新称为独立最终测试。第3章报告48次运行的所选输出检查，不据此宣称历史源码/构建绑定完整。"
      },
      {
        "line": 201,
        "text": "| 黏度 | h=75, d=100 | 2 | μ=15 mPa·s，P/T |"
      },
      {
        "line": 210,
        "text": "Verification is reported in Sec. III. The analytic limit, geometry-specific refinement, tensor/viscosity consistency and output audit are distinct checks. Neither steady-state convergence nor agreement of internal consistency relations establishes a universal spatial-error bound or physical validation. For reference, TABLE II retains the archived fine-grid estimates, conditional on the batch-provenance reconciliation in Sec. III D3; they must not be assigned to the 5 nm production grid."
      },
      {
        "line": 222,
        "text": "验证见第3章。解析极限、具体几何加密、张量/黏度自洽性与输出审计是不同层面的检查。达到稳态或满足内部自洽关系，都不等于获得普遍空间误差上界或物理确认。TABLE II保留归档的细网格估计，但须结合第3章D3的批次来源限制；不能移用于5 nm生产网格。"
      },
      {
        "line": 279,
        "text": "reported separately for each principal direction. Because both $K^{\\rm mod}$ and $K^{\\rm DNS}$ are computed for the same geometry, the same driving and the same normalization, $E$ measures the discrepancy relative to the discrete numerical reference; interpreting it as closure error also requires accounting for the uncertainty of that reference. It absorbs neither a difference in the definition of $K$ nor a difference in the reference height, and it does not depend on the viscosity (Sec. IV)."
      },
      {
        "line": 313,
        "text": "两个主方向分别报告。由于 $K^{\\rm mod}$ 与 $K^{\\rm DNS}$ 针对同一几何、同一驱动、同一归一化，$E$ 衡量相对于离散数值参考解的偏差；解释为闭合误差时仍须计入参考解的不确定度；它既不含 $K$ 定义口径的差异，也不含参考高度的差异，且与黏度无关（Sec. IV）。"
      }
