        "line": 17,
        "text": "Verification is separated into an analytic-limit check, geometry-specific discretization checks, internal tensor/viscosity consistency checks and an existing-output audit. The parallel-plate benchmark is not a nonzero-groove reference solution. Spot refinement does not establish a full-map error bound. Tensor predictions use principal coefficients obtained with the same solver and therefore are not independent external validation. The audit checks recorded outputs, not a complete historical source/build/environment chain."
      },
      {
        "line": 23,
        "text": "验证分为解析极限、具体几何离散检查、张量/黏度内部自洽性、既有输出审计。平板基准不是非零沟槽的参考解；点加密不能给全地图误差上界；张量预测采用同一求解器得到的主值，因此不是外部独立物理确认；输出审计不等于完整历史源码—构建—环境链验收。"
      },
      {
        "line": 207,
        "text": "**Viscosity.** At h=75 nm, d=100 nm, increasing μ from 1 to 15 mPa s changes K by −0.0006444% parallel and −0.0002832% perpendicular; the original-to-high-viscosity flux ratios are 15.0000967 and 15.0000425. This supports the expected scaling under the stated Newtonian, no-slip, low-inertia assumptions. It is not validation of arbitrary real-resist rheology, and the μ=1 field images must retain their actual physical labels."
      },
      {
        "line": 215,
        "text": "**黏度。** h75/d100下，μ从1增至15 mPa·s，K的沿槽/跨槽变化分别为−0.0006444%、−0.0002832%；原黏度与高黏度的通量比分别为15.0000967、15.0000425。这支持既定牛顿、无滑移、低惯性条件下的比例关系，不验证任意真实胶流变。μ=1原场图片必须保留其真实物性标签。"
