    "docs/reports/第一篇论文_第4章结果I草稿_20261018.md": [
      {
        "line": 14,
        "text": "We report first the resolved coefficients themselves, before any comparison with a closure. Two quantities are needed, $K_\\parallel$ (transport along the grooves, driven across $x$) and $K_\\perp$ (transport across the grooves, driven across $y$), obtained from Eq. (4) at steady state for the thirty-six geometries of TABLE I. Both are quoted as $K$ in m³, consistent with the per-unit-width definition of Sec. II G; conversion to the three-dimensional permeability used in porous-media and heat-pipe practice requires division by the period, $K^{[\\mathrm{m^2}]}=K^{[\\mathrm{m^3}]}/P$."
      },
      {
        "line": 30,
        "text": "Panel (b) renders the same statement as a ratio. Across the thirty-six geometries the anisotropy spans $A=1.090$ to $15.45$, a factor of fourteen. It is not the depth alone that produces this: at fixed $d=100$ nm, $A$ falls from $15.45$ at $h=25$ nm to $2.210$ at $h=75$ nm and $1.432$ at $h=125$ nm. Conversely, at fixed $h=125$ nm, $A$ rises only from $1.090$ to $1.503$ as $d$ goes from 25 to 120 nm."
      },
      {
        "line": 82,
        "text": "在与任何闭合比较之前，先报告解出来的系数本身。需要两个量：$K_\\parallel$（沿槽输运，沿 $x$ 驱动）与 $K_\\perp$（跨槽输运，沿 $y$ 驱动），由式 (4) 在稳态下对 TABLE I 的三十六种几何求得。两者均以 m³ 给出，与 Sec. II G 的单位宽度定义一致；若要换算成多孔介质与热管惯用的三维渗透率，需除以周期：$K^{[\\mathrm{m^2}]}=K^{[\\mathrm{m^3}]}/P$。"
      },
      {
        "line": 105,
        "text": "对工艺设计而言，最重要的推论是：**压印沟槽中输运的方向性由残膜有多薄控制，而不由图案有多深控制。** 若设计者想降低方向性——让胶在面内两个方向流得更均匀——**唯一有效的杠杆是 $h$。**"
      }
    ],
    "docs/reports/第一篇论文_第5章_对比对象选择草稿_20261018.md": [
      {
        "line": 16,
        "text": "The resolved calculations and the Reynolds closure use the same definition of transport coefficient: viscosity times mean depth-integrated flux divided by the imposed gradient. Their relative discrepancy is $E_i=K_i^{\\rm mod}/K_i^{\\rm ref}-1$, where $K_i^{\\rm ref}$ denotes the discrete numerical reference. The arithmetic–harmonic averaging step is exact within the stated one-dimensional Reynolds cell model; the comparison therefore tests that local closure against explicitly resolved flow. It does not remove the discretization uncertainty of the numerical reference or locate the discrepancy within the fluid domain."
      },
      {
        "line": 86,
        "text": "精细计算与 Reynolds 闭合采用相同的输运系数定义：黏度乘以平均深度积分通量，再除以外加梯度。相对偏差为 $E_i=K_i^{\\rm mod}/K_i^{\\rm ref}-1$，其中 $K_i^{\\rm ref}$ 是离散数值参考值。算术—调和平均在所述一维 Reynolds 单元模型内可精确求出，故此处比较的是该局部闭合与显式流动计算；这既不消除参考解自身的离散误差，也不定位偏差来自流体域的何处。"
      }
